{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30369","headline":"宿何书记先辈延福新居 · 赵嘏","name":"宿何书记先辈延福新居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松下有琴闲未收，一灯高爲石丛留。\n诗情似到山家夜，树色轻含御水秋。\n小榼提携终永日，半斑容鬓漫生愁。\n因君抚掌问时俗，紫阁堆檐不举头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}